  "sn2.19:1.2": "ṭhito kho Uttaro devaputto Bhagavato santike imaṃ gātham abhāsi || || 2. ",
  "sn2.19:2.1": "Upanīyati jīvitam appam āyu || ",
  "sn2.19:2.2": "jarūpanītassa na santi tāṇā || ",
  "sn2.19:2.3": "etaṃ bhayaṃ maraṇe pekkhamāno || ",
  "sn2.19:2.4": "puññāni kayirātha sukhāvahānīti || || 3. ",
  "sn2.19:3.1": "Upanīyati jīvitam appam āyu || ",
  "sn2.19:3.2": "jarūpanītassa na santi tāṇā || ",
  "sn2.19:3.3": "etaṃ bhayaṃ maraṇe pekkhamāno || ",
  "sn2.19:3.4": "lokāmisaṃ pajahe santipekkho ti || || 10 Anāthapiṇḍiko. 1. Ekam antaṃ "
